---
import LegalLayout from '@/layouts/LegalLayout.astro';
---

<LegalLayout
  title="Cookie Policy"
  updated="September 2026"
  description="How Compliance Navigator uses cookies. We use Google Analytics for aggregate usage and no advertising cookies."
>
  <p>
    Short version: we use Google Analytics to understand, in aggregate, how the
    site is used. We do not use advertising or cross-site tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Analytics cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We use <strong>Google Analytics 4</strong> to measure aggregate, anonymous
    usage, such as which topics are viewed and how people move through the site.
    Google Analytics sets cookies (for example <code>_ga</code> and
    <code>_ga_&lt;id&gt;</code>) to distinguish visitors and sessions. IP
    addresses are anonymized, and we do not use this data to identify you
    personally.
  </p>

  <h2>No advertising cookies</h2>
  <p>
    We do not use advertising, remarketing, or cross-site tracking cookies.
  </p>

  <h2>Managing cookies</h2>
  <p>
    You can block or delete cookies in your browser settings, and the site will
    still work. You can also opt out of Google Analytics using Google's
    <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener">opt-out browser add-on</a>.
  </p>

  <h2>Third-party requests</h2>
  <p>
    We load web fonts from Google Fonts, which are delivered from Google's
    servers to display the site's typography.
  </p>

  <h2>Changes</h2>
  <p>
    We may update this policy as the product evolves. Material changes will be
    reflected by the "last updated" date above.
  </p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>
    Questions? Reach us at
    <a href="mailto:privacy@wyzer.io">privacy@wyzer.io</a>.
  </p>
</LegalLayout>
